\pard\sb180\sa80\brdrb\brdrs\brdrw10\brsp40\keepn \fs22 PROFESSIONAL SUMMARY\b0\par
\pard\sa80 \fs21 Digital media and editorial operations professional with \b 13+ years\b0  leading content production, digital publishing workflows and editorial projects in deadline-driven newsroom and institutional environments. Experienced in turning complex subject-matter expertise into clear, accurate, accessible documentation \'97 style guides, standard operating procedures, user guides and training materials \'97 and in keeping central content repositories organised, current and consistent. Track record of coordinating subject matter experts, technical teams and end users through the selection, rollout and adoption of new digital platforms, and of managing multiple concurrent projects to fixed deadlines. Combines exceptional written communication, analytical quality control and stakeholder engagement, now applied to enterprise digital transformation, ERP/HR system change and user adoption. Undergraduate degree in Mass Communication & Journalism; experienced in international, multi-site and cross-cultural settings.\par
\pard\sb180\sa80\brdrb\brdrs\brdrw10\brsp40\keepn \fs22 CORE COMPETENCIES\b0\par
\pard\sa80 \fs21 \b Digital transformation & change support:\b0  change management \'b7 change impact assessment \'b7 stakeholder mapping \'b7 business readiness activities \'b7 user adoption and training \'b7 managing resistance \'b7 go-live communications \'b7 risk and mitigation logging \'b7 continuous improvement\par
\pard\sa80 \fs21 \b Content, knowledge & documentation management:\b0  Help / knowledge-base content \'b7 standard operating procedures (SOPs) \'b7 user guides \'b7 how-to videos and multimedia learning content \'b7 central repository and document lifecycle management \'b7 taxonomy, naming conventions and version control \'b7 plain-language and audience-tailored writing \'b7 consistency and accessibility standards \'b7 review and maintenance cycles\par
\pard\sa80 \fs21 \b Coordination, delivery & stakeholders:\b0  editorial and digital project coordination \'b7 managing multiple concurrent projects \'b7 cross-functional coordination \'b7 subject matter expert (SME) engagement \'b7 prioritisation and deadline management \'b7 workflow mapping and process improvement \'b7 quality assurance and verification \'b7 team leadership and mentoring \'b7 remote, multi-site and vendor coordination\par
\pard\sa80 \fs21 \b Analysis, engagement & communication:\b0  user feedback collection and analysis \'b7 content and digital analytics \'b7 data-driven recommendations \'b7 internal communications planning \'b7 training design and delivery \'b7 workshop facilitation \'b7 reporting and escalation\par
\pard\sa80 \fs21 \b Digital tools & platforms:\b0  content management systems (CMS) \'b7 digital publishing and asset management \'b7 collaboration platforms (Microsoft 365, Teams, SharePoint, Google Workspace) \'b7 workflow tools ([Asana / Trello / Jira]) \'b7 analytics dashboards ([Google Analytics]) \'b7 HTML/CSS fundamentals \'b7 AI-assisted content tools \'b7 workforce, point-of-sale and stock/inventory systems ([name them]) \'b7 Workday HCM and enterprise HR/ERP: no hands-on experience to date; familiarising with core HCM concepts and Workday Help structure through [self-study, e.g. Workday Essential Training \'97 delete clause if not undertaken]\par
